OL,4,CNorth Korea expels Swiss diplomat in   
OL,5,Csanctions row                          
OL,6,GNorth Korea has ordered Switzerland's  
OL,7,Gdiplomatic representative to leave the 
OL,8,Gcountry within 48 hours and called for 
OL,9,Gthe office to close, in a row over     
OL,10,Gsanctions.                             
OL,12,FIt followed Switzerland's decision to  
OL,13,Fplace sanctions on the Songdowon       
OL,14,Finternational children's camp in the   
OL,15,Feastern city of Wonsan, which is       
OL,16,Fattended by Russian and Chinese        
OL,17,Fchildren among other nationalities.    
OL,19,FThe camp has been accused of           
OL,20,Finvolvement in transferring children   
OL,21,Ffrom Russian-occupied areas of Ukraine.
